    "model_answer": "The provided documents do not contain enough evidence to determine which specific genes are regulated by TRalpha2 in the heart. However, Document 4 suggests that TRalpha1 and TRbeta1 may regulate genes involved in cardiac hypertrophy, but it does not specify whether TRalpha2 regulates these same genes or different ones. Additionally, Document 2 mentions that both TRalpha",
