    "query_text": "What is caused by biallelic variants in PCDHGC4?",
    "reference_answer": "Biallelic variants in PCDHGC4 cause a novel neurodevelopmental syndrome with progressive microcephaly, seizures, and joint anomalies.",
    "model_answer": "The evidence is insufficient as the provided documents do not mention any biallelic variants in PCDHGC4 causing any specific condition or effect.",
