    "query_text": "Which IDH inhibitors by Agios Pharmaceuticals have been approved by the FDA?",
    "reference_answer": "Enasidenib and ivosidenib, the IDH2 and IDH1 inhibitors developed by Agios Pharmaceuticals, have been approved by the Food and Drug Administration",
    "model_answer": "The IDH inhibitors by Agios Pharmaceuticals that have been approved by the FDA are enasidenib (IDH2 inhibitor) and ivosidenib (IDH1 inhibitor). They were approved on August 1, 2017, and July 20, 2018, respectively, for the treatment of adult relapsed or refractory acute myeloid leukemia (AML) with ID",
